  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Asia Indigenous People Pact AIPP - Asia Indigenous People AIPP</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Asia Indigenous People Pact AIPP</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">AIPP&apos;m&#xe5;l &#xe4;r att arbeta f&#xf6;r ursprungsbefolkningen i Asien och ge dem   m&#xf6;jlighet att effektivt delta i demokratiska och politiska processer  genom att fr&#xe4;mja och skydda deras r&#xe4;ttigheter. Samt att ge dem        tillg&#xe5;ng till alla former av media utan att diskrimineras.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Asia Indigenous Peoples Pact&#xb4;s overall objective is that indigenous   people in Asia are effectively participating in democratic and        political processes through the promotion and protection of their     rights to have access to all forms of media withouth discrimination.</narrative>
  </description>
